{"page_id": "synth_copies-sve3bb77cb-p1", "markdown": "# Page 9610 of 10444\n\nFrom:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nDate: January 1, 2021 at 10:02:05 PM EST\n\nTo: (b)(6): (b)(7)(C)\n\nCIDIỊi\n\n(b)(6);\n\n@uscp.gov>\n\n@usss.dhs.gov>\n\nSubject: 12.30.20\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7X(C)\n\nGood evening zid\n\n(by6)% Hope you enjoyed a happy and healthy new year. Below please find a\n\nreport submitted to the FBI for your visibility:\n\nNew iSalute Message-\n\nTime of Submission: 2020/12/30 05:00:32\n\nCategory: Other (Informational Information)\n\nDescription: Hello my name is Sergeant\n\n(b)(6): (b)(7)(C)\n\nand I am a DACP Desk Sergeant\n\nwith the Ft. Leonard Wood Military Police. And during my shift I received a phone call at the Military Police Desk from a\n\n(bX6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nHe was wanting to report that he\n\nhad a hunch that on January 6, 2021 that there would be a chemical or biological attack in a water reservoir in Washington D.C. and that there should be extra security at the inauguration. I would like to make sure that this gets reported/known.\n\nSubmitter Information-\n\nFirst Name:\n\n(bX6)\n\nMiddle Name: (bx6):\n\nLast Name:\n\n(b)(6);\n\n(b)(7)(C)\n\nCitizenship: Cluzen\n\nPrimary Phone:\n\n(b(6): (6X7XC)\n\nPrimary Phone Type: Cellular\n\nAlternate Phone:\n\nAlternate Phone Type:\n\nCity/Base: FT. Leonard Wood\n\nState/Country: Missouri\n\nEmail Address:\n\nSpecial Agent\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nUnited States Capitol Police\n\nCriminal Investigations Section\n\nFBI Cyber Task Force Officer\n\nOffice:\n\n(b)6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nPrimary: (bX6): (b)(7)(C)\n\nAlternate bic) @fbi.gov", "width": 1700, "height": 2200, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "Page 9610 of 10444", "bbox": {"x": 760.6468999304582, "y": -5.5000004550720405e-08, "width": 178.70619946091654, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "From:", "bbox": {"x": 284.0970347502246, "y": 210.83333324166665, "width": 87.06199460916443, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "